<title>USA: Disney's &quot;Dalmatians&quot; pulls in $45 mln.</title>
<headline>Disney's &quot;Dalmatians&quot; pulls in $45 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK, Calif. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney Co said its film &quot;101 Dalmatians&quot; pulled in more than $45 million at the box office, setting a new record for the five day Thanksgiving Day holiday weekend.</p>
<p>In a statement, Disney said the film topped the previous holiday record of $43 million set by &quot;Back to the Future II&quot; in 1989.</p>
